Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat: integrate LLM-based AI assistant into external
 weather service

- Add system prompt defining assistant persona and workflow with `get_weather` tool calling
- Replace direct weather request handling with LLM reasoning: extract city, call tool, generate friendly response
- Keep existing weather card generation and image upload logic
- Include `call_llm` and `select_api_key` from LLM service
- Update service description to reflect AI digital employee for weather queries
